# Project Workspaces

Daily development for this project usually happens across three sibling/local directories:

- `../leaplab`: design-related workspace.
- `../unilabcloud`: backend workspace.
- `.` / `Uni-Lab-OS`: unilabos client workspace on this machine.

When working on Uni-Lab tasks, first choose context and implementation targets from these directories according to the task domain: design in `../leaplab`, backend in `../unilabcloud`, and client/local Uni-Lab-OS code in this repository.
